          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-2">Observations : WordPress Divi genere un HTML de 257 Ko, cache desactive (max-age=0). Le site est heberge sur o2switch — hebergeur mutualize français, pas de CDN global. Temps de reponse serveur : 0.20s (bon), mais Divi charge un JS builder lourd a chaque visite.</p>
          <a href={`https://pagespeed.web.dev/report?url=${urlSite}`} target="_blank" class="text-sm text-primary-600 underline hover:text-primary-800 mt-2 inline-block">Tester sur PageSpeed →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Observatory -->
    <details class="group border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3 bg-white">
      <summary class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden hover:bg-neutral-50/50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-base">🔒</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm">Securite</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-500">{techVerdicts[1].detail}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 border-t border-neutral-100">
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 py-2">Note Mozilla Observatory : {tech.observatory.grade} — score {tech.observatory.score}/100 ({tech.observatory.testsOk}/{tech.observatory.testsTotal} tests passes)</p>
        {tech.headers.map(h => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 py-1">
            {h.ok
              ? <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-green-500 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              : <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
            }
            <span class={`text-xs ${h.ok ? 'text-neutral-600' : 'text-red-500'}`}>{h.h}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Schema.org -->
    <details class="group border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3 bg-white">
      <summary class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden hover:bg-neutral-50/50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-base">📊</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 text-sm">Donnees structurees (Schema.org)</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-neutral-500">{techVerdicts[3].detail}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-400 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 border-t border-neutral-100">
        {tech.schema.map(s => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 py-1">
